# ImmuniGuide

ImmuniGuide is a Flask-based immunisation data application using
WHO health news and a local SQLite vaccination database.

## Requirements

- Python 3
- Internet connection for WHO News
- Windows / macOS / Linux

## Installation

Clone the repository:

git clone https://github.com/br4dleyhub/ImmuniGuide.git

Enter the project:

cd ImmuniGuide

Create a virtual environment:

python -m venv venv

Activate the environment on Windows:

venv\Scripts\activate

Install dependencies:

pip install -r requirements.txt

## Run the application

python app.py

Open your browser:

http://127.0.0.1:5000

## Features

- Explore vaccination data
- Compare vaccination coverage
- View vaccination trends
- View WHO health news and insights

## Data

Vaccination data is stored in the SQLite database:

immunisation-2.db

WHO news is retrieved from the WHO API.
